means use primarily intended for commercial advantage or monetary compensation,
including selling the Project, paid access, paid client deliverables, or using it
as part of business operations. A nonprofit status alone does not establish that
a use is noncommercial. Incidental hosting or transmission fees charged by an
unaffiliated provider do not alone make personal use commercial.

